ResumeIQ — AI-Powered Resume Analyzer & Career Recommendation Platform

**Analyze your resume. Discover your skills. Explore your career opportunities.**

ResumeIQ is a Generative & Agentic AI course project designed to help students, graduates, and job seekers understand their resumes, identify skill gaps, and discover suitable career opportunities using Natural Language Processing (NLP) and machine-learning techniques.

> **Project status:** In Development
> **Project type:** Academic AI Project
> **Primary language:** Python
> **Frontend:** React, TypeScript
> **Backend:** FastAPI

## 1. Problem Statement

Job seekers often struggle to determine whether their resumes match job requirements. They may not recognize missing skills, understand resume weaknesses, or know which career opportunities best match their qualifications.

ResumeIQ addresses this problem by processing resume content, comparing it with job descriptions, identifying relevant skills, and generating explainable career recommendations.

## 2. Target Users

* University students and fresh graduates
* Job seekers preparing for applications
* Professionals exploring career changes
* Career advisors and university placement teams

## 3. Key Features

* **Resume Upload:** Upload supported resume documents.
